{"speciesId":556,"names":{"fr":"Maracachi","es":"Maractus","en":"Maractus","ja":"マラカッチ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Avec une danse et des sons saccadés, il fait fuir ses prédateurs, les Pokémon Oiseaux dévoreurs de graines de fleur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It uses an up-tempo song and dance to drive away the bird Pokémon that prey on its flower seeds."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vit dans les endroits secs. Quand il bouge son corps en rythme, il fait un bruit de maracas."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it moves rhythmically, it makes a sound similar to maracas, making the surprised Pokémon flee."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it moves rhythmically, it makes a sound similar to maracas, making the surprised Pokémon flee."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Avec une danse et des sons saccadés, il fait fuir ses prédateurs, les Pokémon Oiseaux dévoreurs de graines de fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Espanta a los Pokémon pájaro con un baile rápido y haciendo ruido para evitar que picoteen las semillas de sus flores."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It uses an up-tempo song and dance to drive away the bird Pokémon that prey on its flower seeds."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"アップテンポの 踊りと 音で 花の タネを ねらう 天敵の とりポケモンを 追い払うのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit dans les endroits secs. Quand il bouge son corps en rythme, il fait un bruit de maracas."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en territorio árido. Emite un sonido parecido a unas maracas si se mueve de forma rítmica."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"乾燥した 土地で 暮らす。 体を リズミカルに 動かすと マラカスのような 音を 奏でる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Avec une danse et des sons saccadés, il fait fuir ses prédateurs, les Pokémon Oiseaux dévoreurs de graines de fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Espanta a los Pokémon pájaro con un baile rápido y haciendo ruido para evitar que picoteen las semillas de sus flores."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It uses an up-tempo song and dance to drive away the bird Pokémon that prey on its flower seeds."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"アップテンポの 踊りと 音で 花の タネを ねらう 天敵の とりポケモンを 追い払うのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il vit dans les endroits secs. Quand il bouge son corps en rythme, il fait un bruit de maracas."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vive en territorio árido. Emite un sonido parecido a unas maracas si se mueve de forma rítmica."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"乾燥した 土地で 暮らす。 体を リズミカルに 動かすと マラカスのような 音を 奏でる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il produit un bruit de maracas. Quand il danse à un rythme enjoué, il surprend les Pokémon oiseaux, qui s’enfuient alors à tire-d’aile."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Emite un sonido parecido a unas maracas. Se mueve con un ritmo marchoso para sorprender a los Pokémon pájaro, que huyen espantados."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"With noises that could be mistaken for the rattles of maracas, it creates an upbeat rhythm, startling bird Pokémon and making them fly off in a hurry."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"マラカスの ような 音を だす。 陽気な リズムに 鳥ポケモンは 驚き 慌て 飛び去っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il sème les graines de ses fleurs une fois par an. Celles-ci abondent en nutriments et représentent une denrée précieuse dans le désert."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Una vez al año, esparce sus semillas, cuyo alto valor nutritivo las convierte en una inestimable fuente de alimento en el desierto."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Once each year, this Pokémon scatters its seeds. They’re jam-packed with nutrients, making them a precious food source out in the desert."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"１年に 一度 種を まく。 花の 種は 栄養満点で 砂漠の 貴重な 食料。"}],"varieties":[{"id":556,"moves":[{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",20],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-drain","learns":[[11,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[20,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[11,"level-up",6],[14,"level-up",6],[15,"level-up",6],[16,"level-up",6],[17,"level-up",6],[18,"level-up",6],[20,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[11,"level-up",50],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",50],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",50],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",50],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",50],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",50],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",48],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"petal-dance","learns":[[11,"level-up",38],[14,"level-up",38],[15,"level-up",38],[16,"level-up",38],[17,"level-up",38],[18,"level-up",38],[20,"level-up",56]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"screech","learns":